                "text": "In honor of Virgin Islands History Month and Women's History Month, today we present Lucinda S. Millin, a dedicated public servant and advocate for social welfare in the U.S. Virgin Islands.\n\nHer work in healthcare and social services greatly improved the quality of life for the elderly and undeserved communities, leaving a lasting legacy of compassion and progress.\n\nPic Credit: The Virgin Islands Daily News",
