                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "In honor of Virgin Islands History Month and Women's History Month, today we present Myrah Keating Smith, a healthcare pioneer in the U.S. Virgin Islands.\n\nHer legacy lives on through her contributions to public health and her efforts to ensure accessible healthcare for the people of the Virgin Islands. \n\nPic Credit: Wikipedia",
