                "reply_count": 36,
                "retweet_count": 114,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "22 million Americans. 20,000 Virgin Islanders. That\u2019s how many rely on Medicaid. Republicans want to slash over $880 BILLION in healthcare funding\u2014devastating our most vulnerable: children, seniors, veterans. HHS is already shutting down. Washington\u2019s actions are hurting the Virgin Islands. We will not stay silent.",
