                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 16,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Our seniors are the foundation of our families and the bedrock of our communities.\n\nThis Older Americans Month, we share our appreciation for America\u2019s seniors and reaffirm our promise to protecting Social Security and Medicaid \u2013 the hard-earned benefits that they worked their entire lives for.",
